{"vid":"fsWrnjQQoF4","source":"fsWrnjQQoF4.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0,"txt":"It absorbs thermal energy, bringing it"},{"t":2.8,"txt":"right to the edge of its boiling point"},{"t":4.6,"txt":"as it approaches the distillation"},{"t":6.1,"txt":"column. As the heated feed enters the"},{"t":8.5,"txt":"column, the sudden drop in pressure"},{"t":10.8,"txt":"causes a portion of the liquid to"},{"t":12.4,"txt":"instantly vaporize. This is called"},{"t":14.8,"txt":"flashing."},{"t":16.2,"txt":"The lighter vapors immediately rise"},{"t":18.2,"txt":"upwards, while the remaining heavy"},{"t":20.2,"txt":"liquid drops down to flow across the"},{"t":22.1,"txt":"plates. As the liquid travels, a small"},{"t":24.9,"txt":"metal lip called a weir forces it to"},{"t":26.9,"txt":"pool up on the tray. Once the liquid"},{"t":29.1,"txt":"gets high enough, it overflows and falls"},{"t":31.5,"txt":"down the downcomer, continuing its"},{"t":33.5,"txt":"journey to the next plate. Pooling the"},{"t":35.8,"txt":"liquid like this does something"},{"t":37.3,"txt":"critical. It increases its residence"},{"t":39.7,"txt":"time. This slow down gives the rising"},{"t":42.2,"txt":"vapor time to punch through the liquid."},{"t":44.5,"txt":"As they mix, heavy particles drop out of"},{"t":47.3,"txt":"the vapor and into the liquid."},{"t":50.1,"txt":"While lighter particles boil out of the"},{"t":52.3,"txt":"liquid and join the vapor. In this"},{"t":54.6,"txt":"specific column, we are using sieve"},{"t":56.9,"txt":"plates. While there are several"},{"t":58.7,"txt":"different types of trays out there, the"},{"t":60.7,"txt":"sieve plate is a simple, effective way"},{"t":62.9,"txt":"to provide the massive surface area"},{"t":64.7,"txt":"needed for this transfer of heavy and"},{"t":66.6,"txt":"light components. Eventually, the heavy"},{"t":69.4,"txt":"liquid completes its journey down the"},{"t":71.2,"txt":"plates and pools at the very bottom of"},{"t":73.1,"txt":"the column. From here, it slowly flows"},{"t":76,"txt":"into the reboiler, typically a kettle"},{"t":77.9,"txt":"style reboiler, to be reheated. Inside"},{"t":80.7,"txt":"the reboiler, steam is pumped through a"},{"t":82.7,"txt":"tube bundle, transferring its heat into"},{"t":85.2,"txt":"the liquid. This intense heat causes a"},{"t":87.8,"txt":"portion of the fluid to boil and"},{"t":89.5,"txt":"vaporize. This newly formed hot vapor is"},{"t":92.6,"txt":"routed directly back into the column to"},{"t":94.7,"txt":"maintain the upward pressure. Meanwhile,"},{"t":97.4,"txt":"the liquid that doesn't vaporize"},{"t":99.2,"txt":"continues to be monitored. If it meets"},{"t":101.6,"txt":"the required chemical specifications,"},{"t":104.2,"txt":"it is officially drawn out of the system"},{"t":106.3,"txt":"as our heavy bottom product. Meanwhile,"},{"t":109.1,"txt":"the lightest components that"},{"t":110.5,"txt":"successfully boiled all the way to the"},{"t":112.4,"txt":"top of the column exit as a hot vapor."},{"t":114.9,"txt":"This vapor passes through a condenser,"},{"t":117.5,"txt":"typically a shell and tube heat"},{"t":119,"txt":"exchanger. Cold cooling water flows"},{"t":121.6,"txt":"through the tubes, pulling the heat out"},{"t":123.6,"txt":"of the vapor and condensing it back into"},{"t":125.6,"txt":"a liquid form. This new liquid collects"},{"t":128.4,"txt":"in a reflux drum. From here, the flow is"},{"t":131.3,"txt":"split. A portion is recycled back into"},{"t":134.2,"txt":"the top of the column as reflux to help"},{"t":136.3,"txt":"cool the rising vapors. The rest, if it"},{"t":139.2,"txt":"meets our strict chemical"},{"t":140.4,"txt":"specifications, is drawn off as our"},{"t":142.9,"txt":"final overhead distillate product."},{"t":145.4,"txt":"Getting that top distillate product out"},{"t":147.6,"txt":"is a precise balancing act between"},{"t":149.6,"txt":"temperature control and level control."},{"t":152.1,"txt":"It starts with the temperature trigger."},{"t":154.5,"txt":"The vapor rising to the top has a"},{"t":156.4,"txt":"specific boiling point that correlates"},{"t":158.6,"txt":"directly to its chemical composition."},{"t":161,"txt":"The thermocouple measures this. If the"},{"t":163.6,"txt":"temperature gets too high, meaning"},{"t":165.2,"txt":"heavier unwanted molecules are creeping"},{"t":167.4,"txt":"up, the control system automatically"},{"t":169.2,"txt":"increases the reflux, pumping cold"},{"t":171.6,"txt":"condensed liquid back in to knock those"},{"t":173.5,"txt":"heavy molecules back down. Once the pure"},{"t":176,"txt":"vapor passes through the condenser and"},{"t":178.1,"txt":"turns into a liquid, it pools in the"},{"t":180.4,"txt":"overhead reflux drum. This brings in our"},{"t":183.2,"txt":"level trigger. A level transmitter,"},{"t":185.8,"txt":"often using differential pressure,"},{"t":187.8,"txt":"guided wave radar, or a float, monitors"},{"t":190.8,"txt":"exactly how full this drum is getting."},{"t":193.2,"txt":"Here is the brilliant part. The column"},{"t":195.5,"txt":"doesn't measure the spec inside the drum"},{"t":197.5,"txt":"and then open a valve. Instead, as pure"},{"t":200.4,"txt":"vapor continuously condenses, the level"},{"t":203,"txt":"controller simply says, \"The drum is"},{"t":205.2,"txt":"getting full. Open the distillate"},{"t":207,"txt":"product valve to drain some out.\""},{"t":209.4,"txt":"Because our temperature control is"},{"t":211.1,"txt":"already keeping the heavy molecules out,"},{"t":213.5,"txt":"we know that as long as the temperature"},{"t":215.1,"txt":"is correct, the liquid in this drum is"},{"t":217.2,"txt":"guaranteed to be on spec. The bottom of"},{"t":219.7,"txt":"the column operates on the exact same"},{"t":221.8,"txt":"principles, just in reverse. It starts"},{"t":225.1,"txt":"with the temperature trigger. A"},{"t":226.9,"txt":"temperature sensor in the lower trays or"},{"t":229.2,"txt":"the reboiler constantly measures the"},{"t":231,"txt":"heat. If the temperature is too low,"},{"t":233.6,"txt":"meaning light, easily vaporized"},{"t":235.6,"txt":"molecules are still trapped in the"},{"t":237.1,"txt":"bottom liquid, the control system"},{"t":239.2,"txt":"signals the reboiler to add more heat,"},{"t":241.7,"txt":"usually via steam, to boil them off."},{"t":244.2,"txt":"Just like at the top, we also have a"},{"t":246.4,"txt":"level trigger. As the heavy liquid pools"},{"t":249.1,"txt":"at the base of the column, a level"},{"t":250.9,"txt":"transmitter constantly watches this"},{"t":252.8,"txt":"accumulation. As the heavy liquid"},{"t":255,"txt":"accumulates, the level controller opens"},{"t":257.5,"txt":"the bottoms product valve to pump it out"},{"t":259.4,"txt":"to storage, keeping the liquid level in"},{"t":261.7,"txt":"the column perfectly steady. Because the"},{"t":264.2,"txt":"reboiler temperature is being strictly"},{"t":266.1,"txt":"maintained, that liquid is known to be"},{"t":268.4,"txt":"on spec. All of these control loops"},{"t":270.8,"txt":"exist for one reason, to keep the column"},{"t":273.2,"txt":"in perfect balance. If they don't supply"},{"t":275.8,"txt":"enough heat to the reboiler, the vapor"},{"t":278,"txt":"pressure drops. Without enough gas"},{"t":280.3,"txt":"pushing up, the liquid stops flowing"},{"t":282.4,"txt":"across the trays and just dumps straight"},{"t":284.4,"txt":"down through the holes. This is called"},{"t":286.6,"txt":"weeping, and it completely ruins the"},{"t":288.9,"txt":"separation. On the other hand, if the"},{"t":291.4,"txt":"controls fail and they blast too much"},{"t":293.4,"txt":"heat, the gas shoots up so violently"},{"t":295.8,"txt":"that the liquid can't fall down. The"},{"t":297.8,"txt":"liquid gets pinned to the upper trays,"},{"t":300.1,"txt":"and the tower literally backs up like a"},{"t":301.9,"txt":"clogged drain. This is called flooding."},{"t":304.9,"txt":"When a column floods, the liquid gets"},{"t":306.9,"txt":"carried straight out the top, destroying"},{"t":309.1,"txt":"the purity of the overhead product. It's"},{"t":311.6,"txt":"a catastrophic process failure that can"},{"t":313.7,"txt":"shut down a multi-million dollar plant"},{"t":315.6,"txt":"in minutes. Distillation isn't just"},{"t":318,"txt":"about applying heat, it's about"},{"t":320,"txt":"perfectly balancing temperatures,"},{"t":322,"txt":"pressures, and flow rates to pull pure"},{"t":324.4,"txt":"products out of complex mixtures. If"},{"t":326.8,"txt":"this breakdown helped you understand the"},{"t":328.6,"txt":"process, hit the like button and"},{"t":330.8,"txt":"subscribe for more 3D engineering"},{"t":332.9,"txt":"animations."}],"words":[{"t":0,"w":"It"},{"t":0.44,"w":"absorbs"},{"t":1,"w":"thermal"},{"t":1.4,"w":"energy,"},{"t":2.24,"w":"bringing"},{"t":2.6,"w":"it"},{"t":2.76,"w":"right"},{"t":3.08,"w":"to"},{"t":3.2,"w":"the"},{"t":3.32,"w":"edge"},{"t":3.52,"w":"of"},{"t":3.6,"w":"its"},{"t":3.76,"w":"boiling"},{"t":4.16,"w":"point"},{"t":4.56,"w":"as"},{"t":4.72,"w":"it"},{"t":4.8,"w":"approaches"},{"t":5.36,"w":"the"},{"t":5.44,"w":"distillation"},{"t":6.12,"w":"column."},{"t":6.96,"w":"As"},{"t":7.16,"w":"the"},{"t":7.28,"w":"heated"},{"t":7.72,"w":"feed"},{"t":8.08,"w":"enters"},{"t":8.44,"w":"the"},{"t":8.52,"w":"column,"},{"t":9.4,"w":"the"},{"t":9.52,"w":"sudden"},{"t":9.84,"w":"drop"},{"t":10.12,"w":"in"},{"t":10.28,"w":"pressure"},{"t":10.76,"w":"causes"},{"t":11.12,"w":"a"},{"t":11.2,"w":"portion"},{"t":11.6,"w":"of"},{"t":11.68,"w":"the"},{"t":11.76,"w":"liquid"},{"t":12.24,"w":"to"},{"t":12.36,"w":"instantly"},{"t":12.88,"w":"vaporize."},{"t":14,"w":"This"},{"t":14.24,"w":"is"},{"t":14.4,"w":"called"},{"t":14.76,"w":"flashing."},{"t":16.16,"w":"The"},{"t":16.4,"w":"lighter"},{"t":16.76,"w":"vapors"},{"t":17.32,"w":"immediately"},{"t":17.92,"w":"rise"},{"t":18.24,"w":"upwards,"},{"t":19.16,"w":"while"},{"t":19.36,"w":"the"},{"t":19.44,"w":"remaining"},{"t":19.92,"w":"heavy"},{"t":20.2,"w":"liquid"},{"t":20.56,"w":"drops"},{"t":20.92,"w":"down"},{"t":21.2,"w":"to"},{"t":21.32,"w":"fl